302	     * last two digits of the {@link #getFiscalYear() fiscal year} of the business-day-adjusted
303	     * registration date (e.g. {@code 'SMI-0007-M27'}). Derived from the owner's own fields;
304	     * absent until both the customer code and registration date have been assigned.
305	     */
